{"2593340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wonderia", "steam_appid": 2593340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/515a727241ead0e5c6fb0fc67065dc92.avif?t=1785405495\" width=1170 height=1587 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 'Wonderia', a unique open-world game set on an alien planet. Your journey combines survival, creativity, and exploration in a dynamic, procedurally generated environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a vast, ever-changing sandbox world. Uncover resources and secrets hidden across diverse landscapes, each offering unique challenges and opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/dcd55bd44f4e38c65cea2585998c670d.poster.avif?t=1785405495\" width=720 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/dcd55bd44f4e38c65cea2585998c670d.webm?t=1785405495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/dcd55bd44f4e38c65cea2585998c670d.mp4?t=1785405495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and customize homes for space travelers, influencing them to make this world their new home. Your constructions directly affect the planet's landscape and ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/3f9988d91fe6dfeab0cf4fa6a6ab9457.avif?t=1785405495\" width=1170 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/d2e36d503e4c8ad6449afbc570a24261.poster.avif?t=1785405495\" width=720 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/d2e36d503e4c8ad6449afbc570a24261.webm?t=1785405495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/d2e36d503e4c8ad6449afbc570a24261.mp4?t=1785405495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into mysterious dungeons scattered across the planet. Navigate through complex labyrinths and uncover hidden treasures in these subterranean realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/732b151ffeefb8754e28dbe0b43a6035.poster.avif?t=1785405495\" width=720 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/732b151ffeefb8754e28dbe0b43a6035.webm?t=1785405495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/732b151ffeefb8754e28dbe0b43a6035.mp4?t=1785405495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivate an alien garden, planting seeds collected on your travels. Delve into the art of fishing, capturing exotic aquatic species in hidden nooks of the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/5b15ffecfef7fceb927ed326cdf3e4c0.poster.avif?t=1785405495\" width=720 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/5b15ffecfef7fceb927ed326cdf3e4c0.webm?t=1785405495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/5b15ffecfef7fceb927ed326cdf3e4c0.mp4?t=1785405495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with your harvests and catches in the kitchen, concocting culinary creations that offer surprising benefits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy 'Wonderia' solo or with up to 7 others in multiplayer mode. Work together or compete in constructing, exploring, and surviving on this alien planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Wonderia' offers a blend of adventure and creativity, where your decisions shape the world and your experience in this alien landscape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/9ccd77801526cabf704c9a44447e38ef.poster.avif?t=1785405495\" width=720 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/9ccd77801526cabf704c9a44447e38ef.webm?t=1785405495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/9ccd77801526cabf704c9a44447e38ef.mp4?t=1785405495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 'Wonderia', a unique open-world game set on an alien planet. Your journey combines survival, creativity, and exploration in a dynamic, procedurally generated environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a vast, ever-changing sandbox world. Uncover resources and secrets hidden across diverse landscapes, each offering unique challenges and opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/dcd55bd44f4e38c65cea2585998c670d.poster.avif?t=1785405495\" width=720 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/dcd55bd44f4e38c65cea2585998c670d.webm?t=1785405495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/dcd55bd44f4e38c65cea2585998c670d.mp4?t=1785405495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and customize homes for space travelers, influencing them to make this world their new home. Your constructions directly affect the planet's landscape and ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/3f9988d91fe6dfeab0cf4fa6a6ab9457.avif?t=1785405495\" width=1170 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/d2e36d503e4c8ad6449afbc570a24261.poster.avif?t=1785405495\" width=720 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/d2e36d503e4c8ad6449afbc570a24261.webm?t=1785405495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/d2e36d503e4c8ad6449afbc570a24261.mp4?t=1785405495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into mysterious dungeons scattered across the planet. Navigate through complex labyrinths and uncover hidden treasures in these subterranean realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/732b151ffeefb8754e28dbe0b43a6035.poster.avif?t=1785405495\" width=720 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/732b151ffeefb8754e28dbe0b43a6035.webm?t=1785405495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/732b151ffeefb8754e28dbe0b43a6035.mp4?t=1785405495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivate an alien garden, planting seeds collected on your travels. Delve into the art of fishing, capturing exotic aquatic species in hidden nooks of the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/5b15ffecfef7fceb927ed326cdf3e4c0.poster.avif?t=1785405495\" width=720 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/5b15ffecfef7fceb927ed326cdf3e4c0.webm?t=1785405495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/5b15ffecfef7fceb927ed326cdf3e4c0.mp4?t=1785405495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with your harvests and catches in the kitchen, concocting culinary creations that offer surprising benefits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy 'Wonderia' solo or with up to 7 others in multiplayer mode. Work together or compete in constructing, exploring, and surviving on this alien planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Wonderia' offers a blend of adventure and creativity, where your decisions shape the world and your experience in this alien landscape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/9ccd77801526cabf704c9a44447e38ef.poster.avif?t=1785405495\" width=720 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/9ccd77801526cabf704c9a44447e38ef.webm?t=1785405495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/extras/9ccd77801526cabf704c9a44447e38ef.mp4?t=1785405495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Wonderia's an open-world, manga-art adventure just waiting to be explored. It's got sci-fi sim elements, deep dungeons, and you can even morph into alien form! Grab up to 7 friends to mine, craft, battle, and level—or farm and fish the day away, if that's more your tempo. There's so much to do!", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Traditional Chinese, French, German, Russian, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2593340/28c5418e6db35aa2dd4c35de14bae164b28eb58b/header.jpg?t=1785405495", "c